    "confidence": "medium",
    "notes": "The quantities are exact: netting the 22 transactions the attacker sent to its module between blocks 51546496 and 51553000 gives 3470866212.40 TEL and 37.080124317370778845 LINK moving out of Telcoin wallet proxies into attacker control. The USD figure is the reported one because marking that quantity at the pre-incident spot price is not realisable: TEL fell from 0.002358 to 0.0008175 within five minutes of the drain as the attacker sold, and 3.47 billion TEL at the pre-crash price would be about USD 8.2 million against a realised figure that contemporaneous reporting puts at USD 1.2 to 1.25 million. The components therefore carry quantity only and the USD total is the reported realisation. Nothing was recovered."
  },
