        "description": "The wallet is an EIP-1167 minimal proxy whose runtime, 0x363d3d373d3d3d363d7310d0e9755c67ab37089acb4f51e8b4ee407fe8535af43d82803e903d91602b57fd5bf3, hardcodes the master 0x10d0e9755c67ab37089acb4f51e8b4ee407fe853 and cannot be repointed. The clone creation by the CloneFactory 0x4cf353974155a600f87d73222f9df0548e2b740e is therefore the change that put that code into service for this execution context, and the proxy emitted no Upgraded event before the exploit."
